      "page": 11,
      "at": [
        14,
        1,
        0,
        40
      ],
      "source": "from the decay of a spin-0 particle fly out, one in the left, and one in the right direction. If we",
      "rect": [
        72.91802215576172,
        507.2744445800781,
        554.0431518554688,
        519.2296752929688
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91802215576172,
        516.60302734375
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "붕괴에서 생긴 두 입자가 각각 왼쪽과 오른쪽으로 날아간다."
    },
    {
      "id": "p11:b14:l2:s0-10",
      "page": 11,
      "at": [
        14,
        2,
        0,
        10
      ],
      "source": "measure spin ‘up’ along the axis",
      "rect": [
        72.91802215576172,
        518.8284912109375,
        239.41812133789062,
        530.78369140625
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91802215576172,
        528.1570434570312
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "왼쪽에서 축"
    },
    {
      "id": "p11:b14:l2:s13-38",
      "page": 11,
      "at": [
        14,
        2,
        13,
        38
      ],
      "source": " on the left side, then we get spin ‘down’ on the right side,",
      "rect": [
        248.9906463623047,
        518.8284912109375,
        553.975830078125,
        530.78369140625
      ],
      "point": [
        248.9906463623047,
        528.1570434570312
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "방향으로 위쪽 스핀을 측정하면 오른쪽에서는 아래쪽 스핀이 측정되며,"
    },
    {
      "id": "p11:b14:l3:s0-26",
      "page": 11,
      "at": [
        14,
        3,
        0,
        26
      ],
      "source": "and vice versa. The correlation between the right side and left side measurements is",
      "rect": [
        72.91802978515625,
        531.115478515625,
        504.1660461425781,
        543.0706787109375
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91802978515625,
        540.4440307617188
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "그 반대도 성립한다. 왼쪽과 오른쪽 측정 결과 사이의 상관은"
    },
    {
      "id": "p11:b14:l4:s0-8",
      "page": 11,
      "at": [
        14,
        4,
        0,
        8
      ],
      "source": "However, our experiment is disturbed by the Evil Permutators on both side of the experiment,",
      "rect": [
        72.91799926757812,
        547.6505126953125,
        554.04296875,
        559.605712890625
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91799926757812,
        556.9790649414062
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "그러나 실험 양쪽에 있는 “사악한 순열 조작자들”이 실험을 방해하므로"
    },
    {
      "id": "p11:b14:l5:s0-18",
      "page": 11,
      "at": [
        14,
        5,
        0,
        18
      ],
      "source": "and we can only access the experimental data through them.",
      "rect": [
        72.91799926757812,
        559.2045288085938,
        384.9248962402344,
        571.1597290039062
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91799926757812,
        568.5330810546875
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "우리는 그들을 통해서만 자료를 받을 수 있다."
    },
    {
      "id": "p11:b14:l6:s0-24",
      "page": 11,
      "at": [
        14,
        6,
        0,
        24
      ],
      "source": "The Evil Permutators’ activity is the following (and they operate independently): they take",
      "rect": [
        72.91799926757812,
        576.4705200195312,
        554.0669555664062,
        588.4257202148438
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91799926757812,
        585.799072265625
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "각 조작자는 서로 독립적으로 다음과 같이 행동한다. 연속된"
    },
    {
      "id": "p11:b14:l7:s0-0",
      "page": 11,
      "at": [
        14,
        7,
        0,
        0
      ],
      "source": "5—20 consecutive experimental results and make a permutation on them in an evil and random",
      "rect": [
        72.91799926757812,
        588.6885375976562,
        554.0789184570312,
        600.6437377929688
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91799926757812,
        598.01708984375
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "5~20개의 측정 결과를 골라 악의적이고 무작위적인"
    },
    {
      "id": "p11:b14:l8:s0-30",
      "page": 11,
      "at": [
        14,
        8,
        0,
        30
      ],
      "source": "way. They only send us the resulting data only after all the measurements are done. They",
      "rect": [
        72.91799926757812,
        600.2424926757812,
        554.0431518554688,
        612.1976928710938
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91799926757812,
        609.571044921875
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "순열로 뒤섞는다. 모든 측정이 끝난 뒤에야 결과 자료를"
    },
    {
      "id": "p11:b14:l9:s0-32",
      "page": 11,
      "at": [
        14,
        9,
        0,
        32
      ],
      "source": "decide in a random way how many measurements they permute at a time as well. This way",
      "rect": [
        72.91799926757812,
        611.7965087890625,
        554.0310668945312,
        623.751708984375
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91799926757812,
        621.1250610351562
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "보내며, 한 번에 뒤섞는 측정 개수도 무작위로 결정한다."
    },
    {
      "id": "p11:b14:l10:s0-20",
      "page": 11,
      "at": [
        14,
        10,
        0,
        20
      ],
      "source": "the left side measurements will not match the right side ones.",
      "rect": [
        72.91799926757812,
        623.3515014648438,
        388.6668701171875,
        635.3067016601562
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91799926757812,
        632.6800537109375
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "그 결과 왼쪽 측정과 오른쪽 측정의 대응이 사라진다."
    },
    {
      "id": "p11:b14:l11:s0-36",
      "page": 11,
      "at": [
        14,
        11,
        0,
        36
      ],
      "source": "Do we still have a chance to find out if the left and right side data was correlated originally?",
      "rect": [
        72.91799926757812,
        639.8865356445312,
        554.0671997070312,
        651.8417358398438
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91799926757812,
        649.215087890625
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "그럼에도 원래 좌우 자료가 상관되어 있었는지 알아낼 수 있는가?"
    },
    {
      "id": "p11:b14:l12:s0-22",
      "page": 11,
      "at": [
        14,
        12,
        0,
        22
      ],
      "source": "If yes, how many measurements should we plan for a given accuracy?",
      "rect": [
        72.91799926757812,
        651.4404907226562,
        428.2745056152344,
        663.3956909179688
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91799926757812,
        660.76904296875
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "가능하다면 주어진 정확도를 얻으려면 측정을 몇 번 계획해야 하는가?"
    },
    {
      "id": "p11:b15:l0:s0-2",
      "page": 11,
      "at": [
        15,
        0,
        0,
        2
      ],
      "source": "(Győző Egri)",
      "rect": [
        487.33099365234375,
        681.6575317382812,
        553.9214477539062,
        693.6127319335938
      ],
      "point": [
        487.33099365234375,
        690.986083984375
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
